      ":question/problem": "Which of the following is the graph of $y=\\frac{1}{5x}?$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "To plot $y=\\frac{1}{5x},$ we apply the following steps:\n\n- Take the curve $y=\\frac{1}{x}.$\n\n![](images/0f/0fe642f3c7873344885b0e030fb449a8bf882120e675f18d72668ccae3ef4b40.png)\n\n- Stretch the result by a scale factor of $\\frac{1}{5}$ parallel to the $y$-axis to get the graph of $y=\\frac{1}{5x}.$\n\n![](images/6c/6c7b719326bfa1a4b53fdf2bce3f6e7f1dafe5de2c994ffb4951a6d79af78707.png)"
